{"schema":"contra-studio/contradb-interpretation","version":1,"sourceSnapshotId":"contradb:363:0a828ee30b61eb52","snapshot":{"schema":"contra-studio/contradb-snapshot","version":1,"sourceUrl":"https://contradb.com/dances/363","retrievedAt":"2026-10-20T06:04:10.475Z","html":"<h1 class=\"dance-show-title\">Midwest Folklore</h1>\n<p class=\"dance-show-hook\">hook: simple</h2>\n<p class=\"dance-show-choreographer\">by: <strong><a href=\"/choreographers/57\">Orace Johnson</a></strong></p>\n<p class=\"dance-show-formation\">formation: Becket </p>\n<div class=\"dance-show-preamble\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'></div></div>\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-condensed contra-table-nonfluid\">\n         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>A1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>2</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">slide left along set ⁋</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>6</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">circle left 3 places</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">neighbors do si do once</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 dance-show-long-figure\">\n             <td>A2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>16</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">neighbors balance &amp; swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>B1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">circle left 3 places</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners do si do once</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 dance-show-long-figure\">\n             <td>B2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>16</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners balance &amp; swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr></table>\n<div class=\"dance-show-notes\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'><p>Bob Isaacs notes: Hailing from Urbana, IL, Orace Johnson was a pillar of the Midwest contra community until his passing in 1991 while contra dancing.  This simple dance is as pure as it gets.  It also inspired one of the best contra books, Midwest Folklore, a collection of the best dances from the Midwest’s best choreographers.</p>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"dance-show-publish\">\n            shared everywhere\n          </p>\n"},"interpretation":{"notesReview":"provenance-only","sourceHook":"descriptive","rows":{"contradb:363:row:3":{"balanceBeats":4},"contradb:363:row:6":{"balanceBeats":4}},"circulation":"cw"}}
